{"id":"ics-009","stemHtml":"<p>函数</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">long f(long a, long b, long c, long d, long e, long g, long h, long i);\n</code></pre>\n<p>的汇编开头是</p>\n<pre><code>f:\n    pushq %rbp\n    movq %rsp, %rbp\n    subq $32, %rsp\n    ...\n</code></pre>\n<p>(1) 8 个参数分别通过什么传递？</p>\n<p>(2) 若进入 <code>f</code> 时 <code>%rsp = 0x7fffffffe008</code>，求返回地址、第 7 个参数、第 8 个参数、保存的 <code>%rbp</code> 的地址；执行完 <code>pushq %rbp</code>、<code>movq %rsp, %rbp</code>、<code>subq $32, %rsp</code> 后，<code>%rbp</code> 与 <code>%rsp</code> 各是多少？</p>\n<p>(3) <code>subq</code> 的立即数 32 是怎么定的？如果函数里有 4 个 <code>long</code> 局部变量并要调用其他函数，为什么这个数必须是 16 的倍数？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>先记住约定：前 6 个整型参数走寄存器，从第 7 个开始从右往左压栈；进入函数时，栈顶是返回地址。<code>pushq %rbp</code> 会把 <code>%rsp</code> 再减 8，所以「返回地址在 <code>8(%rbp)</code>」而不是 <code>0(%rbp)</code>。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> System V AMD64 约定：6 个整型参数依次放在</p>\n<p><code>%rdi</code>、<code>%rsi</code>、<code>%rdx</code>、<code>%rcx</code>、<code>%r8</code>、<code>%r9</code>，</p>\n<p>即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span> 中的前六个。第 7 个（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span>）和第 8 个（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span>）从右往左压栈，位于栈上。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 进入函数时，栈顶 <code>0(%rsp)</code> 是返回地址，所以</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>返回地址</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>008.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{返回地址}=0x7fffffffe008.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回地址</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">008.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>第 7 个参数在 <code>8(%rsp)</code>，第 8 个在 <code>16(%rsp)</code>：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>第 7 个参数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>010</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>第 8 个参数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>018.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{第 7 个参数}=0x7fffffffe010,\\qquad \\text{第 8 个参数}=0x7fffffffe018.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\"> 7 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">010</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">第</span><span class=\"mord\"> 8 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个参数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">018.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><code>pushq %rbp</code> 把旧 <code>%rbp</code> 存到 <code>%rsp-8 = 0x7fffffffe000</code>，此时 <code>%rsp = 0x7fffffffe000</code>；<code>movq %rsp, %rbp</code> 后</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>000.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rbp=0x7fffffffe000.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">000.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>因此保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code> 在 <code>0(%rbp)</code>，返回地址在 <code>8(%rbp)</code>，第 7 个参数在 <code>16(%rbp)</code>，第 8 个在 <code>24(%rbp)</code>。最后 <code>subq $32, %rsp</code>：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rsp=0x7fffffffe000-0x20=0x7fffffffdfe0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> 进入函数时 <code>%rsp % 16 = 8</code>（<code>call</code> 压了 8 字节返回地址）；<code>pushq %rbp</code> 后再减 8，变成 <code>%rsp % 16 = 0</code>。之后每次 <code>subq</code> 只要减的是 16 的倍数，<code>%rsp % 16 = 0</code> 就保持不变，于是调用下一个函数时 <code>call</code> 前仍满足 ABI 的 16 字节对齐。</p>\n<p>4 个 <code>long</code> 局部变量需要 32 字节，正好是 16 的倍数，所以 <code>subq $32</code>。若需要 24 字节，就要取 32——「不小于需求的最小 16 的倍数」。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把第 7 个参数写成 <code>0(%rsp)</code> 或 <code>8(%rbp)</code>——那是返回地址的位置。二是忘记 <code>pushq %rbp</code> 占掉 8 字节，于是把返回地址算到 <code>0(%rbp)</code>。三是把 8 个参数全算成寄存器传递（寄存器只有 6 个）。四是 <code>subq</code> 后忘记 <code>%rsp</code> 再减 32，或把 32 当成十进制以外的单位。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>前六个参数在 rdi、rsi、rdx、rcx、r8、r9，第 7、8 个在栈上；返回地址 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffe008</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffe008}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffe008</span></span></span></span></span>，第 7 个参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffe010</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffe010}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffe010</span></span></span></span></span>，第 8 个参数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffe018</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffe018}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffe018</span></span></span></span></span>，旧 rbp 在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffe000</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffe000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffe000</span></span></span></span></span>，RBP 为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffe000</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffe000}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffe000</span></span></span></span></span>、RSP 为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">0x7fffffffdfe0</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{0x7fffffffdfe0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">0x7fffffffdfe0</span></span></span></span></span>；subq 取不小于需求的最小 16 的倍数</p>\n"}